            {
              "text": "His friends looked at Toad while he sat on the ground.",
              "audioStart": 76.438,
              "audioEnd": 78.963
            },
            {
              "text": "They knew that something strange had happened to him.",
              "audioStart": 79.825,
              "audioEnd": 82.062
            },
            {
              "text": "Toad did not care about the broken van at all.",
              "audioStart": 82.925,
              "audioEnd": 85.213
            },
            {
              "text": "He only thought about the fast machine that had passed them.",
              "audioStart": 86.075,
              "audioEnd": 88.9
            },
            {
              "text": "The beautiful vehicle had gone away down the road.",
              "audioStart": 89.763,
              "audioEnd": 92.125
            },
            {
              "text": "Toad stayed in the same place for a long time.",
              "audioStart": 92.987,
              "audioEnd": 95.388
            },
            {
              "text": "His friends tried to talk to him, but he did not listen.",
              "audioStart": 96.25,
              "audioEnd": 99.2
            },
            {
              "text": "He dreamed about the road and the fast machines.",
              "audioStart": 100.062,
              "audioEnd": 102.575
            },
            {
              "text": "Life would never be the same for him again.",
              "audioStart": 103.438,
              "audioEnd": 105.438
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "They had to leave the broken van behind them.",
              "audioStart": 106.3,
              "audioEnd": 108.362
            },
            {
              "text": "Walking back home took many hours.",
              "audioStart": 109.225,
              "audioEnd": 111.225
            },
            {
              "text": "During the walk, Toad spoke only about fast machines.",
              "audioStart": 112.088,
              "audioEnd": 115.25
            },
            {
              "text": "He decided that he must buy one as soon as possible.",
              "audioStart": 116.112,
              "audioEnd": 118.838
            },
            {
              "text": "His friends tried to stop him from having such ideas.",
              "audioStart": 119.7,
              "audioEnd": 122.487
            },
            {
              "text": "They knew that fast machines brought danger and trouble.",
              "audioStart": 123.35,
              "audioEnd": 126
            },
            {
              "text": "However, Toad would not listen to any advice.",
              "audioStart": 126.862,
              "audioEnd": 129.45
            },
            {
              "text": "His mind was completely changed by that single afternoon.",
              "audioStart": 130.312,
              "audioEnd": 133.488
            },
            {
              "text": "Days passed, and Toad stayed inside his large house.",
              "audioStart": 134.35,
              "audioEnd": 137.363
            },
            {
              "text": "He refused to see any visitors or friends.",
              "audioStart": 138.225,
              "audioEnd": 140.625
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone in the village wondered what had happened to him.",
              "audioStart": 141.488,
              "audioEnd": 144.025
            },
            {
              "text": "The truth was simple.",
              "audioStart": 144.887,
              "audioEnd": 146.062
            },
            {
              "text": "Toad was planning to buy a fast machine.",
              "audioStart": 146.925,
              "audioEnd": 148.988
            },
            {
              "text": "He had already written letters to several people who sold such vehicles.",
              "audioStart": 149.85,
              "audioEnd": 153.4
            },
            {
              "text": "Money was not a problem for a wealthy man like him.",
              "audioStart": 154.262,
              "audioEnd": 156.85
            },
            {
              "text": "Soon, a large delivery would arrive at his front door.",
              "audioStart": 157.713,
              "audioEnd": 160.575
            },
            {
              "text": "The quiet life of the river bank was about to end.",
              "audioStart": 161.438,
              "audioEnd": 163.912
            },
            {
              "text": "New adventures waited for them just around the corner.",
              "audioStart": 164.775,
              "audioEnd": 167.287
            },
            {
              "text": "Toad would soon discover the power of the open road.",
              "audioStart": 168.15,
              "audioEnd": 170.537
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing could stop him from reaching his new goal.",
              "audioStart": 171.4,
              "audioEnd": 173.7
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun shone down upon the green fields while he planned his future.",
              "audioStart": 174.562,
              "audioEnd": 177.988
            },
            {
              "text": "He imagined himself driving very fast across the whole country.",
              "audioStart": 178.85,
              "audioEnd": 182.287
            },
            {
              "text": "His friends hoped that he might change his mind again.",
              "audioStart": 183.15,
              "audioEnd": 185.713
            },
            {
              "text": "Yet they knew that hope was entirely dead.",
              "audioStart": 186.575,
              "audioEnd": 188.762
            },
            {
              "text": "Toad wanted only speed and excitement.",
              "audioStart": 189.625,
              "audioEnd": 191.7
            },
            {
              "text": "No power on earth could hold him back now.",
              "audioStart": 192.562,
              "audioEnd": 194.7
            },
            {
              "text": "The wonderful car would soon become his most prized possession.",
              "audioStart": 195.562,
              "audioEnd": 198.637
            },
            {
              "text": "He smiled at the thought of the coming journey.",
              "audioStart": 199.5,
              "audioEnd": 201.537
